  "notes": "Material 3-style teal tonal palette (primary #006a6a, secondary container #aedcdb for selected tree node). Top bar is a light grey-green band; icon actions grouped in a rounded grey pill, and the table toolbar repeats that pill. Table header sits on a pale tinted band; rows separated by thin hairlines, no zebra striping. Item-type line icons (note, journal article, book, web page) lead each row. Tags are outlined rounded chips with colored status dots for priority tags, count pills and an inline rename pencil. Notes sort first with blank creator/date. Clicking a row shrinks the table and opens a rounded grey item pane at right with an editable form (item type select, draggable author rows, abstract)."
